{'symbol': 'DOV', 'date': '2022-04-06 17:45:00', 'title': 'DOVER COMPLETES ACQUISITION OF ELECTRIC REFUSE COLLECTION VEHICLE INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY PORTFOLIO', 'text': 'DOWNERS GROVE, ILL. , APRIL 6, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DOVER (NYSE: DOV) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS COMPLETED THE ACQUISITION OF CERTAIN INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY FROM BOIVIN EVOLUTION INC. ("BEV") RELATED TO ELECTRICALLY-POWERED REFUSE COLLECTION VEHICLE ("RCV") BODIES.'}